<title>POLAND: LDA SEES 1996 NET 61 PCT UP AT PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>LDA SEES 1996 NET 61 PCT UP AT PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish printing house Lodzka Drukarnia Akcydensowa SA (LDA) expectes to increase its net profit this year to 810,000 zlotys, 61 percent higher than last year, the company said in a Friday statement.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
